<title>USA: Lowell, Mass., $44 mln bonds won by Bear Stearns.</title>
<headline>Lowell, Mass., $44 mln bonds won by Bear Stearns.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-01-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bear Stearns &amp; Co said it won $44 million of Lowell, Mass., state qualified municipal purpose loan of 1997 limited tax bonds, with a true interest cost of 5.38 percent.</p>
</text>
